I've found that too many of my deaths in NH are due to not knowing
that I was weak from hunger.  Especially when I'm doing something like
solving a sokoban maze or digging a tunnel between staircases.  Many
relatively useless messages appear like "You start digging.  You hit
the rock with all your might.  You make an opening in the wall." or
"With great effort you push the boulder.  You try to move the boulder,
but in vain".  And it is difficult for me to read each one carefully
so I don't miss anything like "You are beginninng to feel hungry" and
"You are beginning to feel weak".  And yes, sometimes I don't enough
attention to the lower right hand corner of the screen where it says
Weak.

It would appear to me that a message about feeling weak from hunger is
tremendously important, so it would be great to just pop up a window
stating such, instead of just the normal message mixed in with the
other trivial messages.  There are other "critical" message that might
be considered as well, such as "You hear the wailing of the Banshee"
when your HP is extremely low.

Am I the only one that has this problem?  Actually my brother has the
same problem, so does this problem just run in my family?



